   <indicator measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output 1  Indicator 1</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output: Output 1 
Indicator: Output 1: Sector strategy and investment plans prepared 
Progress/Status: The ICs have submitted all final reports as part of output 1. The skills expert gave a final report and presentation on the Skills and Capacity Development Plan incorporating all comments and suggestions from the EA/IA and ADB and it has been accepted by the EA/IA.</narrative>
    </description>
   </indicator>
   <indicator measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output 1  Indicator 2</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output: Output 1 
Indicator: Output 2: Feasibility study, detailed engineering designs, and due diligence of priority subprojects completed 
Progress/Status: Feasibility reports for proposed Industrial parks have been finalized and Detailed engineering designs and DPRs for 6 industrial estates (R. K. Nagar, Bodhjungnagar and Kumarghat - with best-in-class infrastructure) and for Dewanpasa, Nagicherra and Dhajanagar have been submitted. The Detailed engineering designs and DPRs of the remaining industrial estates are under preparation and will be submitted by 15 February 2024. The PPR for ensuing project was submitted by the state and DEA has posed the ensuing project to ADB on 9 January 2024.</narrative>
    </description>
   </indicator>
   <indicator measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output 1  Indicator 3</narrative>
    </title>
